{"article":{"id":8569203926804,"url":"https://booxsupport.zendesk.com/api/v2/help_center/en-us/articles/8569203926804.json","html_url":"https://booxsupport.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/8569203926804-User-Manual-Download","author_id":407186820192,"comments_disabled":true,"draft":false,"promoted":false,"position":13,"vote_sum":-441,"vote_count":1177,"upvote_count":368,"downvote_count":809,"section_id":8568847110420,"created_at":"2022-08-15T07:34:43Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T01:45:20Z","name":"User Manual Download","title":"User Manual Download","source_locale":"en-us","locale":"en-us","outdated":false,"outdated_locales":[],"edited_at":"2023-01-03T08:37:52Z","user_segment_id":null,"permission_group_id":993931,"body":"<div data-page-id=\"doxcnfd6U0NIeeomaHuNwZrp5ib\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnKUc88aISW0UqGUJEZk7fRf\">In this article, you will learn how to download the latest user manual of your BOOX device.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnKUc88aISW0UqGUJEZk7fRf\"> </div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-doxcngwim20E8y8mqANBjgyqgxf\">Method 1: Download on your BOOX device</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>In Home Screen, go to <strong>Settings</strong> &gt; <strong>User Manual</strong>.</li>\n<li>Tap to download the user manual of your BOOX device.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnAWQkwggUMKKWWQ7sAiT3We\"> </div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-doxcnGgIGCQUOkIiy2TLgFlUlQc\">Method 2: Download on the website</h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnGIayGS88KgWOYTSPtpD9vf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"doxcnfd6U0NIeeomaHuNwZrp5ib\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnGiui4y8gSCUiWSnb8siXTY\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Log in on one of our send2boox websites on a browser according to the server selection on your BOOX device.<br>US / VN Server: <a href=\"https://push.boox.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://push.boox.com/</a><br>EUR Server: <a href=\"https://eur.boox.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://eur.boox.com/</a>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcngeye6a2QGgm2M9O66BGmtb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Click the <strong>Account</strong> icon in the top right corner.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnMoA6WgQS40aE6GxBT3tUBg\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Switch to the <strong>User Manual</strong> tab.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnEuuGgkWOKuacvEeNZ0LssA\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Select your model and click to download its user manual.</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}}